00:09:27.007 --> 00:09:29.680
"Hey, doc, what do surgeons do with tumors

00:09:29.680 --> 00:09:30.840
once they've been removed?"

00:09:30.840 --> 00:09:33.560
Generally, we send them to pathology

00:09:33.560 --> 00:09:36.660
for analysis through microscopy

00:09:36.660 --> 00:09:38.990
to see A, what kind of tumor they are,

00:09:38.990 --> 00:09:41.600
how differentiated they
are, what cells are present.

00:09:41.600 --> 00:09:45.840
In some cases like with skin
cancers, we do a cutout,

00:09:45.840 --> 00:09:48.030
and sometimes we look right then and there

00:09:48.030 --> 00:09:51.800
to make sure that we cut out
the entire margin of the tumor

00:09:51.800 --> 00:09:54.327
to make sure that we didn't
leave any cancer cells behind.

00:09:54.327 --> 00:09:56.160
"Why do humans randomly to get itchy?

00:09:56.160 --> 00:09:59.860
I understand why you itch from
hairs or bugs being on you,

00:09:59.860 --> 00:10:02.190
but so often I itch when
there's nothing touching me.

00:10:02.190 --> 00:10:04.770
What gives?" Okay, Theresa,
this is very important.

00:10:04.770 --> 00:10:07.590
Because if you are itchy
like that, to that degree,

00:10:07.590 --> 00:10:09.730
perhaps there's a medical
condition going on,

00:10:09.730 --> 00:10:12.090
perhaps allergic, perhaps otherwise,

00:10:12.090 --> 00:10:13.940
but we would need to
investigate that further.

00:10:13.940 --> 00:10:15.890
There's many reasons why humans get itchy.

00:10:15.890 --> 00:10:17.080
Itchiness can come

00:10:17.080 --> 00:10:20.000
from something physically
bothering your skin

00:10:20.000 --> 00:10:22.480
or a chemical reaction
bothering your skin.

00:10:22.480 --> 00:10:23.820
Both can cause itchiness.

00:10:23.820 --> 00:10:25.840
And there's also like the nerve thing.

00:10:25.840 --> 00:10:27.740
Nerves misfire and can make it feel

00:10:27.740 --> 00:10:29.520
like an itching sensation is present

00:10:29.520 --> 00:10:30.497
when it's not really there.

00:10:30.497 --> 00:10:32.520
"I'm thinking about becoming a nurse,

00:10:32.520 --> 00:10:34.230
but I have a serious fear of needles.

00:10:34.230 --> 00:10:35.560
Do you think it's worth pursuing

00:10:35.560 --> 00:10:37.000
or should I look into else?"

00:10:37.000 --> 00:10:38.810
That is something that you can overcome.

00:10:38.810 --> 00:10:40.870
There are legitimate medical treatments

00:10:40.870 --> 00:10:42.560
and therapies targeted at those

00:10:42.560 --> 00:10:44.000
who have phobias of any kind.

00:10:44.000 --> 00:10:46.530
Needles are one that you
can definitely overcome.

00:10:46.530 --> 00:10:47.720
So if that's the sole thing

00:10:47.720 --> 00:10:50.330
that's preventing you from
having an amazing long career

00:10:50.330 --> 00:10:51.210
that is much needed,

00:10:51.210 --> 00:10:53.550
do not let it stop you from
having a very productive,

00:10:53.550 --> 00:10:58.470
rewarding job because of a
phobia that you can overcome.

